      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know you aren't a doctor but i just don't want to spend $300 at the urgent care if it's just a pulled muscle. it really feels like i just tweaked something while lifting that last box. how much ibuprofen do you think is safe to take to actually knock this out so i can sleep? like can i take like 1200mg at once if the pain is really sharp?",
